\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}‖\\sqrt{2}u+\\sqrt{3}v{‖}^{2} & =‖\\sqrt{2}u{‖}^{2}+‖\\sqrt{3}v{‖}^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSimplifying and substituting in the given information, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}‖\\sqrt{2}u+\\sqrt{3}v{‖}^{2} & =(\\sqrt{2}‖u‖)^{2}+(\\sqrt{3}‖v‖)^{2} \\\\ ‖\\sqrt{2}u+\\sqrt{3}v{‖}^{2} & =2‖u{‖}^{2}+3‖v{‖}^{2} \\\\ (\\sqrt{182})^{2} & =2(4)^{2}+3‖v{‖}^{2} \\\\ 182 & =2\\cdot 16+3‖v{‖}^{2} \\\\ 182 & =32+3‖v{‖}^{2} \\\\ 150 & =3‖v{‖}^{2} \\\\ ‖v{‖}^{2} & =50\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $‖v‖=5\\sqrt{2}.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14040753/state.json" "file_sha256" "5c8d5431f2416a11a2ffd140598219391744997246558f294f0abd839312a40a" "basis" 1467 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14040753/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-74109" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14040753/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "6297f9e56cb57b1d79f5f50f4f410d895cc53b635661ae753c51f260a8a7e2bc" "basis" 1467 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14040753/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-74109" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14040753/state.json" "file_sha256" "5c8d5431f2416a11a2ffd140598219391744997246558f294f0abd839312a40a" "basis" 1467 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14040753/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-74109" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/v