56" "5c8d5431f2416a11a2ffd140598219391744997246558f294f0abd839312a40a" "basis" 1467 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14040753/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-74177" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Using the triangle inequality, we have that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}‖u+5v‖ & \\le ‖u‖+‖5v‖.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSimplifying and substituting in the given information, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}‖u+5v‖ & \\le ‖u‖+5‖v‖ \\\\ 19 & \\le 4+5‖v‖ \\\\ 15 & \\le 5‖v‖ \\\\ 3 & \\le ‖v‖.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the smallest possible value of $‖v‖$ is $3.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14040753/state.json" "file_sha256" "5c8d5431f2416a11a2ffd140598219391744997246558f294f0abd839312a40a" "basis" 1467 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14040753/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-74177" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14040753/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "6297f9e56cb57b1d79f5f50f4f410d895cc53b635661ae753c51f260a8a7e2bc" "basis" 1467 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14040753/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-74177" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14040753/state.json" "file_sha256" "5c8d5431f2416a11a2ffd140598219391744997246558f294f0abd839312a40a" "basis" 1467 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacad