\n$$\n\nTherefore, the smallest possible value of $‖u‖$ is $4.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14040753/state.json" "file_sha256" "5c8d5431f2416a11a2ffd140598219391744997246558f294f0abd839312a40a" "basis" 1467 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14040753/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-40244" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14040753/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "6297f9e56cb57b1d79f5f50f4f410d895cc53b635661ae753c51f260a8a7e2bc" "basis" 1467 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14040753/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-40244" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14040753/state.json" "file_sha256" "5c8d5431f2416a11a2ffd140598219391744997246558f294f0abd839312a40a" "basis" 1467 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14040753/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-40244" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "3"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14040753/state.json" "file_sha256" "5c8d5431f2416a11a2ffd140598219391744997246558f294f0abd839312a40a" "basis" 1467 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14040753/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-40244" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "4"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14040753/state.json" "file_sha256" "5c8d5431f2416a11a2ffd140598219391744997246558f294f0abd839312a40a" "basis" 1467 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14040753/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-40244" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "8"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14040753/state.json" "file_sha256" "5c8d5431f2416a11a2ffd140598219391744997246558f294f0abd839312a40a" "basis" 1467 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14040753/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-40244" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{27}{4}"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14040753/state.json" "file_sha256" "5c8d5431f2416a11a2ffd140598219391744997246558f294f0abd839312a40a" "basis" 1467 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14040753/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-40244" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{2}{7}"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14040753/state.json" "file_sha256" "5c8d5431f2416a11a2ffd140598219391744997246558f294f0abd839312a40a" "basis" 1467 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14040753/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-40244" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "4"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14040753/state.json" "file_sha256" "5c8d5431f2416a11a2ffd140598219391744997246558f294f0abd839312a40a" "basis" 1467 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14040753/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-40243" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "If $|u\\cdot v|+‖u+v‖=19$ and $‖v‖=9$, then what is the smallest possible value of $‖u‖?$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14040753/state.json" "file_sha256" "5c8d5431f2416a11a2ffd140598219391744997246558f294f0abd839312a40a" "basis" 1467 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14040753/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-40243" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "First, using the Cauchy-Schwarz inequality, simplifying, and substituting in the given information, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}19 & =|u\\cdot v|+‖u+v‖ \\\\  & \\le ‖u‖\\cdot ‖v‖+‖u+v‖ \\\\  & =‖u‖\\cdot (9)+‖u+v‖ \\\\  & =9‖u‖+‖u+v‖.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, using the triangle inequality, simplifying, and substituting in the given information, we have \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}9‖u‖+‖u+v‖ & \\le 9‖u‖+(‖u‖+‖v‖) \\\\  & =9‖u‖+(‖u‖+9) \\\\  & =10‖u‖+9.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nCombining the two inequalities, we get \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}19 & \\le 10‖u‖+9 \\\\ 10 & \\le 10‖u‖ \\\\ 1 & \\le ‖u‖.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the smallest possible value of $‖u‖$ is $1.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14040753/state.json" "file_sha256" "5c8d5431f2416a11a2ffd140598219391744997246558f294f0abd839312a40a" "basis" 1467 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14040753/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-40243" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14040753/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "6297f9e56cb57b1d79f5f50f4f410d895cc53b635661ae753c51f260a8a7e2bc" "basis" 1467 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14040753/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-40243" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14040753/state.json" "file_sha256" "5c8d5431f2416a11a2ffd140598219391744997246558f294f0abd839312a40a" "basis" 1467 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14040753/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-40243" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "-2"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14040753/state.json" "file_sha256" "5c8d5431f2416a11a2ffd140598219391744997246558f294f0abd839312a40a" "basis" 1467 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14040753/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-40243" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "1"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14040753/state.json" "file_sha256" "5c8d5431f2416a11a2ffd1